<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Ingersoll-Rand raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Ingersoll-Rand raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Schroder Wertheim said it upgraded Ingersoll-Rand Co to outperform from &quot;perform in line.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Ingersoll-Rand gained 5/8 to 44-1/8.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
